    { q: "Isn't this just a HubSpot configuration issue?", a: "It is a platform limitation, not a setting, and the workarounds all fight it. The durable fix is a real parent-child ledger that creates renewals outside the workflow engine." },
  ],
  ctaHeading: "Find the chains about to break",
  ctaBody: "The renewal audit tells you which multi-year chains HubSpot will silently fail to renew at year 3, before the revenue stops. $500, credited in full toward any build. It starts with a free 30-minute call.",
};
